     "body": "<p>The current root-acl comes from here:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-auth-webac/src/main/resources/root-authorization.ttl\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-auth-webac/src/main/resources/root-authorization.ttl</a></p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>..and: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-auth-webac/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/auth/webac/WebACRolesProvider.java#L107\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-auth-webac/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/auth/webac/WebACRolesProvider.java#L107</a></p>",
