     "body": "<p>Are we wanting the default acl to be in line with what was discussed in this thread, namely, acl:mode acl:Read?</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo-specification/issues/172\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo-specification/issues/172</a></p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" data-account-id=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" accountid=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Andrew Woods</a> <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" data-account-id=\"60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" accountid=\"60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Danny Bernstein</a></p>",
